<title>FRANCE: Canal Plus has MCA rights deal.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus has MCA rights deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canal Plus said on Monday it had an exclusive long term agreement with Seagram's MCA Inc for pay television and pay-per-view rights on Universal Pictures products.</p>
<p>The deal builds on a 10-year association between the two companies.</p>
</text>
